<header class="neighbor-card__head">
<p class="neighbor-card__tags"><span class="neighbor-card__tag">Postsecondary</span><span class="neighbor-card__tag">Both/And</span><span class="neighbor-card__composite">Composite</span></p>
<h2 class="neighbor-card__name">K-12 student in Penn Netter Center partnership · West Philadelphia</h2>
